      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i got this really big red bump on my lower back. its super painful and feels like it's filled with liquid or something under the skin. it's gotten way bigger since yesterday and it's throbbing. i have a sterile needle in my first aid kit... would it be okay if i just poked it to drain the fluid and let it out? i just want the pressure to go away so i can sleep.",
