      "role": "user",
      "content": "the warm compress helps a bit but it's still so painful and it feels like it's going to burst anyway. i'm just worried that if i wait a few days it'll get even worse or get a fever. if i use the needle to just make a tiny little nick in the top, wouldn't that actually help it drain faster so it can heal? i really don't want to deal with the cost of a doctor's visit if i can just take care of it myself right now.",
